{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Linga AI 是一款以語音對話為核心的語言學習工具，特別適合想提升真實會話能力、不喜歡背生字卡的用戶。它目前提供終生版限時免費，讓用戶可以免費解鎖完整功能，把握機會即可節省 US $49.99。</p>\n\n<h2>重點功能推介</h2>\n<p>Linga AI 的最大賣點是語音優先學習，用戶直接與 AI 導師對話，系統即時聆聽、回應及修正發音。內置 90 個實境場景，涵蓋酒店入住、餐廳點餐、面試及看醫生等，讓用戶在真實情境中開口。程式支援 26 種語言，並提供清晰的分級課程與連續學習紀錄，初學者到進階用戶都適用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2064x2752bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Linga AI: Learn Languages Fast 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，選右上角的 Lifetime，價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4676\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_4676-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4677\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_4677-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Linga AI: Learn Languages Fast</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T10:19:27.968638+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}